    "title": "JioHotstar Launches Globally to Audiences Across the UK, Canada and Singapore - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Desi Buzz Desk ,\n1 days ago JioHotstar Launches Globally to Audiences Across the UK, Canada and Singapore: JioHotstar today announced its international launch across the UK, Canada and Singapore. The launch goes beyond taking JioHotstar’s extensive entertainment catalogue to new markets. It brings audiences a new way to discover, watch and engage with entertainment combining 160K+ hours of content across 12+ languages and multiple genres with personalized recommendations, interactive features, flexible subscription options and a delightful product experience. Read full article",
